# The periphrastic frame that opens a future offset.  CLDR spells it "fi
# żmien" ("within [the] time") for year, day and hour and "sa" ("up to") for
# week and minute, with month using both; the frame is preposed and the
# direction word ohra trails the unit.  Unicode CLDR 47, mt dateFields.json,
# relativeTime-type-future.
fi żmien
sa
